      <div class="description-box">
        <p><strong>Dear ABC Construction Company,</strong></p>
        <p>Your firm has been selected to provide a proposal for the The Restaurant Store @ Bridge 595 project. 
        We kindly request that you notify us of your intent to provide a bid no later than 
        close of business on the date outlined below. Below, you will also find a series of 
        information to assist you throughout the pricing exercise.</p>
        <p>In the event you have any questions, please feel free to contact 
        Adolfo Reutlinger at areutlinger@gmail.com at your earliest convenience.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">PROJECT DESCRIPTION:</div>
        <div class="description-box">
          <p>This project involves the complete build-out of a 95,000 SF restaurant supply store including warehouse space, existing office renovation, and new office construction. The scope includes HVAC, electrical, plumbing, flooring, and all finish work required for a fully operational retail facility.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="section">
        <table class="info-table">
